{"id":"5ad1ed6e19770020","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-stochastic-clock.md","title":"Stochastic Clock","display":"df-stochastic-clock — Stochastic Clock","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-stochastic-clock","aliases":["58-df-stochastic-clock","Stochastic Clock"],"display":"df-stochastic-clock — Stochastic Clock","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-time-change.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-stochastic-clock"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-stochastic-clock</span><span>Stochastic Clock</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stochastic-clock — Stochastic Clock"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cef612157cb4ba5d\" href=\"?note=cef612157cb4ba5d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1038150eeb41d5b7\" href=\"?note=1038150eeb41d5b7\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-time-change.md\">../batch11/58-df-time-change.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in V\">\\(\\Omega\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=[0,\\infty)\">\\(I=[0,\\infty)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_I\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in I\\times I:s\\leq t\\}\">\\(R_I\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in I\\times I:s\\leq t\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F:I\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega))\">\\(\\mathcal F:I\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N:I\\to\\mathbb N^\\Omega\">\\(N:I\\to\\mathbb N^\\Omega\\)</span> 是逐样本单调的计数过程且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_0\">\\(N_0\\)</span> 为零函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:I\\to(I\\cup\\{\\infty\\})^\\Omega\">\\(\\tau:I\\to(I\\cup\\{\\infty\\})^\\Omega\\)</span>，并以空集的下确界为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S(\\tau_u,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,I,R_I)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S(\\tau_u,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,I,R_I)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cef612157cb4ba5d\" href=\"?note=cef612157cb4ba5d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountingClock}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{CountingClock}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in I\">\\(t,u\\in I\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_t\\coloneqq N(t)\">\\(N_t\\coloneqq N(t)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_u\\coloneqq\\tau(u)\">\\(\\tau_u\\coloneqq\\tau(u)\\)</span>；不另引入未绑定的过程族。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stochastic\\text{-}clock} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountingClock}_S(\\tau,N,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\left(N:I\\to\\mathbb N^\\Omega\\land\\tau:I\\to(I\\cup\\{\\infty\\})^\\Omega\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;(N_0(\\omega)=0\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;(\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R_I\\to N_s(\\omega)\\leq N_t(\\omega)))\\land\\forall u\\in I\\;\\left(\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\tau_u(\\omega)=\\inf\\{t\\in I:N_t(\\omega)&gt;u\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S(\\tau_u,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,I,R_I)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stochastic\\text{-}clock} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountingClock}_S(\\tau,N,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\left(N:I\\to\\mathbb N^\\Omega\\land\\tau:I\\to(I\\cup\\{\\infty\\})^\\Omega\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;(N_0(\\omega)=0\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;(\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R_I\\to N_s(\\omega)\\leq N_t(\\omega)))\\land\\forall u\\in I\\;\\left(\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\tau_u(\\omega)=\\inf\\{t\\in I:N_t(\\omega)&gt;u\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2StoppingTime}_S(\\tau_u,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,I,R_I)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Stochastic clock: random time transform; inverse of increasing process</li>\n<li>停时谓词的第五参数现在是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 上的实际序关系图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_I\">\\(R_I\\)</span>，而不是只含一个排版符号的集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\leq\\}\">\\(\\{\\leq\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>时间变换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\tau_u}\">\\(X_{\\tau_u}\\)</span> 是否保持鞅性质还需要适当的过滤、适应性和可积性条件。</li>\n<li>可选抽样等式需要有界停时、统一可积性等标准充分条件之一，不能对任意停时无条件断言。</li>\n<li>Applications: subordination of Lévy processes; random time changes in econometrics</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kallenberg, Foundations of Modern Probability</li>\n<li>Rogers and Williams, Diffusions, Markov Processes and Martingales</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time.md","status":"resolved","id":"cef612157cb4ba5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-prob2-stopping-time.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-time-change.md","status":"resolved","id":"1038150eeb41d5b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":